{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3036","id":3204711498,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886_BARK","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3036","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3036.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3036.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3036","number":3036,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"policy: add comprehensive Tailscale ACL compatibility tests","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"EXPERIMENT:\r\n\r\nThis PR contains a 9000~ line generated test file generated from having Claude agents run various ACL configuration against Tailscale SaaS and then observing the output Packet filters, and turn them into test cases.\r\nThey helped us discover several differences, we are addressing some of them in this PR, and some we will evaluate for later.\r\n\r\nThe tests can be treated as a \"black box\" test, they do not need to be reviewed and are not for humans to review. We use them for regression validation over time.\r\n\r\nAdd extensive test coverage verifying Headscale's ACL policy behavior\r\nmatches Tailscale's coordination server. Tests cover:\r\n\r\n- Source/destination resolution for users, groups, tags, hosts, IPs\r\n- autogroup:member, autogroup:tagged, autogroup:self behavior\r\n- Filter rule deduplication and merging semantics\r\n- Multi-rule interaction patterns\r\n- Error case validation\r\n\r\nKey behavioral differences documented:\r\n- Headscale creates separate filter entries per ACL rule; Tailscale\r\n  merges rules with identical sources\r\n- Headscale deduplicates Dsts within a rule; Tailscale does not\r\n- Headscale does not validate autogroup:self source restrictions for\r\n  ACL rules (only SSH rules); Tailscale rejects invalid sources\r\n\r\nTests are based on real Tailscale coordination server responses\r\ncaptured from a test environment with 5 nodes (1 user-owned, 4 tagged).\r\n\r\nclaude was used in this pr.","created_at":"2026-01-23T20:19:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T18:29:21Z","closed_at":"2026-02-05T18:29:16Z","merged_at":"2026-02-05T18:29:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"e44b402fe461b4bb90115b3751ee0ea39aa9952b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events",